Youth / family / school mediators:

fc_y_fes__confl_mean → Family conflict

fc_y_pm_mean → Parental monitoring (youth report)

fc_y_psb_mean → Youth prosocial behavior

fc_y_srpf__dis_mean → School disengagement

fc_y_srpf__env_mean → School environment

fc_y_srpf__involv_mean → School involvement

Peer mediators:

delinquent_peer_mean

prosocial_peer_mean

Parenting (collected Y1 & Y3 only):

fc_y_crpbi__cg1_mean → Child Report of Parental Behavior Inventory

